Review: **Tao Club**

///PROS///
- Great space--ambiance (lounge/dinner floor)--altho...

snippet:
Three stars for the food, and an extra for the great margaritas;

Food-wise, I left full but don't remember being too impressed based on the number on the receipt, but the service I had was good.

They've got a wide selection of tequilas to fit you budget or tastes, and the mix was pretty good,

Here are the main points for those speed readers out here:
1. This is a nail school in a not so great part of town;
2. Because it is a school, the quality and consistency of the services is unreliable;
